     8	//! drop the per-subcommand `--output-format` override.
     9	//!
    10	//! What this test does NOT do:
    11	//!   * run the subcommands (no network / no filesystem mutation);
    12	//!   * validate the actual JSON payload against the schema (that lives in
    13	//!     per-subcommand integration suites that exercise the dispatch path);
    14	//!   * check the global `--format` flag (already covered by `cli_tests` in
    15	//!     `src/lib.rs`).
    16	//!
    17	//! What it DOES guarantee:
    18	//!   * `Cli::command().debug_assert()` passes (no clap arg-id collision);
    19	//!   * each top-level subcommand parses `--output-format json` and the
    20	//!     resulting `Cli` matches the expected variant;
