EXIT CODES:\n  \
0  Ok               Key set and file committed.\n  \
1  UserError        Bad key / type mismatch / validation failure.\n  \
3  PermanentError   ConfigWriter IO failure.\n\n\
ENV:\n  \
REV_SCRAPING_POLICY      Override the policy.toml path.\n  \
