     2	// Source: vendored from rev_stealth crates @ 6fc38fd
     3	//! rev-stealth CLI library surface.
     4	//!
     5	//! v1.3 (Lane H Slice A): the CLI entrypoint moved from a thin binary
     6	//! into this library so that:
