    15	//!
    16	//! Output format: human-readable (default) or `--format=json` for agent consumers.
    17	//!
    18	//! Exit codes (see `stealth_core::ExitCode`):
    19	//!   0 = ok
    20	//!   1 = user error (bad args / config)
    21	//!   2 = transient error (retryable: network / VPN flap)
    22	//!   3 = permanent error (unsupported / not implemented)
    23	//!   4 = auth expired (Phase 9a)
    24	//!   7 = leak detected / fail-closed (emitted by `doctor`)
    25	
